          "expression": "CONTENT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "You see, it was below... \\.\\.",
          "transl": "Aaalso, sie war unter...\\.\\."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "antagonists.fancyguy",
          "expression": "CONTENT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "It was below the Chief's house? And some strange poles that summoned the Wiccats?",
          "transl": "Sie war unter der Häuptlingshütte? Und ein paar seltsame Stäbe haben die Schnurrken beschworen?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "jungle.female-albino",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "antagonists.fancyguy",
          "expression": "MOPING"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "That really doesn't sound like something humans could do.",
          "transl": "Das klingt wirklich nicht nach etwas, das Menschen getan hätten."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "jungle.female-albino",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
